## When to Hand Off to backend-developer

Hand off when the task requires:
- Adding a new database column or migration
- Writing a service object (business logic)
- Adding a controller or route
- Background job logic
- Authorization rules

You DO write the helper if it's purely presentational (CSS class names, formatting).
